\pard\sa180\f2\fs26\b 9. Current Limitation and Next Step\b0\par
\pard\sa80\f0\fs20 The camera-to-signal demonstration currently updates the frontend simulation state directly. For production, add a telemetry endpoint such as POST /api/telemetry/junctions/{junction_id}. The frontend can then send camera counts to the backend, allowing the backend optimizer to persist telemetry, calculate signal configurations, and broadcast results through WebSockets.\par

\pard\sa320\qc\f2\fs20\b Q-FLOW turns city traffic signals into an intelligent, adaptive emergency-response network.\b0\par
